		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>bonsoir rjuju,<br />voici l&#039;explain analyze</p><p>&quot;Aggregate&#160; (cost=249076.18..249076.19 rows=1 width=2) (actual time=123309.785..123309.788 rows=1 loops=1)&quot;<br />&quot;&#160; -&gt;&#160; Bitmap Heap Scan on t_donnees_fr1&#160; (cost=9729.42..245180.77 rows=519388 width=2) (actual time=1449.767..120127.916 rows=516170 loops=1)&quot;<br />&quot;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Recheck Cond: (varcod = 76)&quot;<br />&quot;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; -&gt;&#160; Bitmap Index Scan on varcod_t_donnees_fr1_idx&#160; (cost=0.00..9599.57 rows=519388 width=0) (actual time=1257.186..1257.186 rows=516170 loops=1)&quot;<br />&quot;&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; Index Cond: (varcod = 76)&quot;<br />&quot;Total runtime: 123364.180 ms&quot;</p><p>ma version est la 9.1 je suis sur windows xp<br />shared_buffer= 1GB<br />work_mem=64MB</p><p>ce qui est étonnant c&#039;est que pour une même config&#160; on a d&#039;un coté 3s et de l&#039;autre 120 s. <br />re bonsoir</p>]]></content>
